{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32598","headline":"及第後宴曲江 · 刘沧","name":"及第後宴曲江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"及第新春选胜游，杏园初宴曲江头。\n紫毫粉壁题仙籍，柳色箫声拂御楼。\n霁景露光明远岸，晚空山翠坠芳洲。\n归时不省花间醉，绮陌香车似水流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}